.TH GBILD 1 gbild
.SH NAME
gbild \- GTK+ 2 Image viewer

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gbild
.RB [ \-f ]
.RI [ file "] ..."

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B gbild
is a GTK+ 2 image viewer.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-f
Start in full-screen mode.

.SH OPERANDS
.TP
.I file
Image file to open.

.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
0
The program exited successfully.
.TP
1
An error occurred.

.SH SEE ALSO
None.
